  Example:

  Creating a generator from a seed:

  >>> g = tf.random.Generator.from_seed(1234)
  >>> g.normal(shape=(2, 3))
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2, 3), dtype=float32, numpy=
  array([[ 0.9356609 ,  1.0854305 , -0.93788373],
